      ],
      "rationale": "The new current P requires personal aliquot transfer, indicator immersion, excess removal, forceps/tube brim filling and raw recording under actual school release. Contextual eye protection, labelling, unknown-material rejection and immediate spill/contact response must be secure before handling. Whole135 preparation and416 weighing/separation routines are unnecessary: the teacher supplies every solution and short product-specific transfer skills can be introduced under supervision within this case.",
